So now we have completed Payment Sub-module so now we can meove to implement next sub-Module of Account Module .
In this sub_module we have to implement 2 main pages Generate Bills page and GST Invoice page . In this module we 
will generate GST invoices only for company this section is not for candiate pay . So lets discuss the how senior 
implement it in her project , As the candidate is placed we are enterting who will pay us (payment_type company Pay , Candidate pay
or Both pay) , how much they have to pay and also applying 18% GST (optional) this data save in tbl_palcement and 
payment related all info also added in tbl_payment . If the payment type = company pay (may be tbl_payment or could be 
tbl_palcement) , have appled gst (company_gst_amount in tbl_placement) and have "gst number and shipping address" (gst_number and shipping_address in 
tbl_associate) then that company appers in Generate Bills page in which we will generate invoice for the payment 
by the company and show the list of that invoices in GST invoice page . lets review seniors code files and table 
scema just to check whether i am correct or not about seniors implementation and what should be our implementation 
plan for our project . "CREATE TABLE `tbl_gst_invoice` (
